cff-version: 1.2.0
title: depthSV
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Association testing of sequencing read depth against phenotypes at biobank
  scale. Joins per-sample depth over fixed genomic bins, corrects for technical
  structure using principal components, and tests each bin against one or more
  phenotypes, producing association summary statistics.
authors:
  - name: depthSV contributors
license: MIT
keywords:
  - copy number variation
  - structural variation
  - read depth
  - genome-wide association study
  - biobank
